        "body": "Aurora Innovation, Inc. is a public company headquartered in Pittsburgh, PA, trading under the ticker AUR and registered with the SEC under CIK 0001828108. It also appears under the name AURORA INNOVATION INC. The company describes itself as delivering self-driving freight, with the tagline \"Self-driving. Game-changing.\" It says its Aurora Driver combines cutting-edge hardware and powerful software backed by verifiable AI to integrate autonomy into trucking fleets.\n\nThe company's website includes statements from partners about pilot operations. One statement describes autonomous hauling between Fort Worth and El Paso using Werner professional drivers and the Aurora Driver. Another mentions the Aurora Driver integrated into the Volvo VNL Autonomous. The site also cites a projection that freight volumes will grow five fold between 2010-2050, and presents autonomous transport as not just an innovation, but a necessity.\n\nThe available material lists 157 legal exposure items in Pennsylvania for Aurora Innovation, Inc. No other product names are given beyond the Aurora Driver.",
